# No unit tests

This project does not have a unit test suite and must not grow one.

Do not:

- Create `*.test.ts`, `*.test.tsx`, `*.spec.ts`, `*.spec.tsx`, or `__tests__/` files
- Add Vitest, Jest, Testing Library, jsdom, Playwright, Cypress, or similar test runners
- Add `test` / `test:watch` scripts, test setup files, or test `types` in tsconfig
- Restore deleted tests, even when changing a component that used to have them

Verify behavior in the demo (`npm run dev`) or by typecheck/lint (`npm run check`). If a change is risky, explain the risk in the PR or commit — do not compensate with a unit test.
